config BR2_PACKAGE_FP3_CAMERA_UTILS
	bool "fp3-camera-utils [FP3+ only]"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_BAYER2RGB_NEON_ARCH_SUPPORTS
	select BR2_PACKAGE_BAYER2RGB_NEON
	select BR2_PACKAGE_JPEG
	help
	  Fairphone 3+ specific camera tooling: stills, live video, raw
	  capture, and an i2c bus probe used during sensor bring-up.

	  Hardware-bound to the msm8953 CAMSS pipeline and the FP3+'s
	  two sensors (rear: Samsung S5KGM1SP / front: Samsung S5K3P9SP).
	  All four binaries assume the FP3+ media graph and will not be
	  useful on other boards.

	  Installs four binaries plus a setup helper:

	    cam-snap    Single-shot JPEG with software ISP (5x5 MHC
	                demosaic, gray-world AWB, gamma + tone curve).
	    cam-stream  Live H.264 over TCP via Venus encoder.
	    cam-grab    Raw 10-bit packed Bayer dump (for piping into
	                GStreamer pipelines that don't grok pgAA).
	    i2cprobe    Tiny i2c-bus scanner used while bringing up
	                camera sensors and VCMs.
	    fp3-cam-setup  Configures the CAMSS media graph (csiphy →
	                csid → ispif → vfe_rdi → /dev/videoN) for the
	                requested sensor.

	  Driven from Elixir via the fp3_camera library.
